#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0586 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "THE FIXTURE THAT PINS THE SHEET DEFECT'S RESOLUTION. AVAL is ZERO, so the percent change is undefined; ArithmeticSemantics.percentChange returns NaN for a zero denominator and differs treats a NaN on either side as 'no violation', so the row is silent whatever PBCHG holds - 999 is deliberately absurd. The workbook's own guard names the WRONG operand (AD0586-F1, sheet issue owed); the engine's zero-DIVISOR carve-out is the coherent reading."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BASE    type=Num
col AVAL    type=Num
col PBCHG   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | 120 | 0 | 999
